  "description": "This is a rhetorical and visual strategy used in the meme to strip the subjects of their humanity by comparing them to animals. It is a form of hate speech and racial stereotyping. The comparison is not literal but symbolic, intended to demean and insult the individuals by implying they are morally or intellectually inferior.",
